three years ago,

877
00:56:33,486 --> 00:56:35,456
after I suffered a miscarriage,

878
00:56:38,016 --> 00:56:40,326
I concluded that I could no longer spend the rest of my life...

879
00:56:42,096 --> 00:56:45,296
